const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"自身难交易与市场变差时一起跌不同",en:"Own illiquidity differs from exposure to market liquidity"},body:{zh:"这篇研究问的是股票收益对全市场流动性变化的敏感度，是否与预期收益有关。一只股票平时成交困难，与它在整个市场流动性恶化时表现较差，是两件事。前者是自身交易特征，后者是收益对共同状态变化的暴露。",en:"The paper asks whether expected returns relate to sensitivity to market-wide liquidity changes. Being difficult to trade normally differs from performing poorly when market liquidity deteriorates. The former is a trading characteristic; the latter is exposure to a common state variable."},reference:{url:"https://rodneywhitecenter.wharton.upenn.edu/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/0121.pdf",label:{zh:"2001年工作稿 · §1",en:"2001 working paper · §1"}}},{title:{zh:"用成交后的反向价格变化刻画一种流动性",en:"Use subsequent reversals to capture one dimension of liquidity"},body:{zh:"作者关注成交压力造成的暂时价格变化：某方向的成交量越大，随后越容易出现反向收益，可能意味着提供流动性需要更大的价格补偿。这只刻画流动性的一个维度，不等于同时测量报价宽度、深度和完成大额交易所需时间。",en:"The measure focuses on temporary price pressure: stronger subsequent reversals after directional volume can indicate greater compensation for supplying liquidity. It captures one dimension, not quoted spreads, depth and the time needed to complete a large trade simultaneously."},reference:{url:"https://rodneywhitecenter.wharton.upenn.edu/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/0121.pdf",label:{zh:"2001年工作稿 · §1; §2.1",en:"2001 working paper · §1; §2.1"}}},{title:{zh:"成交量符号来自超额收益",en:"Volume is signed using market-adjusted returns"},body:{zh:"月内回归把下一日相对市场的收益作为被解释变量，并加入当日收益及带符号的美元成交量。符号取自当日股票相对市场的收益，而非逐笔成交的主动方向。把普通收益、超额收益或真实订单流混换，会改变指标定义。",en:"Within each month, next-day market-adjusted returns are regressed on current returns and signed dollar volume. The sign comes from the stock's return relative to the market, not observed trade initiation. Substituting raw returns or actual order flow changes the definition."},reference:{url:"https://rodneywhitecenter.wharton.upenn.edu/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/0121.pdf",label:{zh:"2001年工作稿 · §2.1 · equation (1)",en:"2001 working paper · §2.1 · equation (1)"}}},{title:{zh:"样本筛选与成交额单位会改变估计",en:"Filters and volume units affect the estimate"},body:{zh:"工作稿要求月内有足够连续观测，并设置股价区间，成交额以百万美元计量。样本还区分不同交易所的成交量统计方式。不同货币单位、停牌处理或数据缺口会影响系数大小，不能直接把数值搬到另一市场作横向排名。",en:"The draft requires sufficient consecutive observations, applies price filters and measures volume in millions of dollars. It also distinguishes exchange volume conventions. Currency units, suspensions and missing observations affect coefficients, preventing mechanical comparisons across markets."},reference:{url:"https://rodneywhitecenter.wharton.upenn.edu/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/0121.pdf",label:{zh:"2001年工作稿 · §2.1 · p. 4",en:"2001 working paper · §2.1 · p. 4"}}},{title:{zh:"市场指标与流动性beta有两层估计",en:"The market measure and liquidity beta are separate estimates"},body:{zh:"研究先从股票层面的测量构造市场流动性，再研究收益对其创新的敏感度。个股的反转系数不是最终的流动性beta，后者也不是个股流动性本身的波动率。阅读相关实证时，应识别每个变量来自哪一层估计。",en:"The study first constructs market liquidity from stock-level measurements, then studies return sensitivity to its innovations. A stock's reversal coefficient is not its liquidity beta, and that beta is not the volatility of its own liquidity. Track each estimation layer separately."},reference:{url:"https://rodneywhitecenter.wharton.upenn.edu/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/0121.pdf",label:{zh:"2001年工作稿 · §1 · pp. 1–2",en:"2001 working paper · §1 · pp. 1–2"}}},{title:{zh:"历史定价证据不等于现成因子数据",en:"Historical pricing evidence is not a ready-made factor dataset"},body:{zh:"工作稿中的定价结论依赖特定美国样本、市场基准和流动性构造。编辑解读：只有日收益和成交额，还不足以声称已经复制原文因子或风险溢价。版本差异、跨股票聚合与后续暴露估计都需要单独核对。",en:"The draft's pricing evidence depends on its US sample, market benchmark and liquidity construction. Editorial interpretation: daily returns and volume alone do not establish replication of the factor or premium. Version differences, aggregation and subsequent exposure estimation remain separate tasks."},reference:{url:"https://rodneywhitecenter.wharton.upenn.edu/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/0121.pdf",label:{zh:"2001年工作稿 · §1; §2.1",en:"2001 working paper · §1; §2.1"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"导读采用2001年稿，讨论市场流动性冲击的暴露，不等同于个股流动性差。日成交量签名只是订单流代理，不能替代真实主动买卖记录。",en:"This guide uses the 2001 draft and studies exposure to market liquidity shocks, not merely an illiquid stock. Signed daily volume proxies order flow; it is not observed trade direction."}};export{e as default};
